FQ Enhanced Combat
------------------

Design and code: lyrkhan.

The combat features gathered here come from the FQ Card Engine
(https://gitlab.com/final-quest/fq-card-engine), where they were written for
Final Quest 8. Only what is generic to the dnd5e system moves here; the Final
Quest card battle system, its cards and its illustrations stay there.


